WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.490 --> 00:00:05.029
Happy Birthday, communism.

00:00:05.029 --> 00:00:07.060
This year marks 100 years

00:00:07.060 --> 00:00:09.000
since communism began.

00:00:12.540 --> 00:00:14.620
The First Revolution was in Russia.

00:00:18.120 --> 00:00:19.540
No longer would capitalists

00:00:19.560 --> 00:00:20.660
exploit workers.

00:00:20.960 --> 00:00:22.240
Now the people would

00:00:22.240 --> 00:00:24.320
prosper together under Lenin.

00:00:26.860 --> 00:00:28.369
But some people resisted,

00:00:28.369 --> 00:00:30.120
so Lenin ordered them killed.

00:00:30.120 --> 00:00:32.223
“You need to hang without fail",

00:00:32.223 --> 00:00:32.980
he said so

00:00:32.980 --> 00:00:34.220
the public sees…

00:00:34.220 --> 00:00:35.580
the death of the rich,

00:00:35.580 --> 00:00:37.580
the bloodsuckers.”

00:00:37.580 --> 00:00:39.860
Stalin continued the killing.

00:00:39.860 --> 00:00:41.812
MILLIONS of people starved because

00:00:41.820 --> 00:00:43.240
it turned out that when

00:00:43.240 --> 00:00:45.360
farmers can’t control their property,

00:00:45.360 --> 00:00:47.760
they don’t produce much food.

00:00:47.760 --> 00:00:49.199
Yet today, many leftist

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:50.660
Antifa activists

00:00:50.660 --> 00:00:52.680
carry communist flags.

00:00:52.920 --> 00:00:53.860
Some say,

00:00:53.860 --> 00:00:57.040
well Russia just didn’t do communism right.

00:00:57.060 --> 00:00:58.820
But when has ANYONE

00:00:58.820 --> 00:01:00.020
done it right?

00:01:00.020 --> 00:01:01.120
The Chinese said

00:01:01.120 --> 00:01:03.140
THEY would make Communism work.

00:01:03.960 --> 00:01:05.540
Instead a mob of teenagers

00:01:05.540 --> 00:01:06.700
called the “Red Guard”

00:01:06.700 --> 00:01:07.860
lined up skeptics

00:01:07.860 --> 00:01:09.640
and executed them.

00:01:09.760 --> 00:01:11.920
Millions were murdered.

00:01:11.929 --> 00:01:14.240
Yet even after years of murder,

00:01:14.240 --> 00:01:15.444
many Chinese people

00:01:15.444 --> 00:01:16.409
still believe.

00:01:16.409 --> 00:01:18.299
Look at these people.

00:01:18.300 --> 00:01:19.464
They are crying.

00:01:19.464 --> 00:01:21.500
Not because they're unhappy,

00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:24.200
they're crying with joy and excitement just

00:01:24.200 --> 00:01:25.980
because they got to see their leader,

00:01:25.980 --> 00:01:27.480
Chairman Mao.

00:01:38.020 --> 00:01:39.540
But Chinese Communism failed

00:01:39.540 --> 00:01:41.440
even the people who worshipped it.

00:01:51.100 --> 00:01:53.340
Lily Tang was a little girl then.

00:01:53.340 --> 00:01:55.220
She loved Mao.

00:02:08.840 --> 00:02:10.360
But about eight years later…

00:02:44.960 --> 00:02:47.180
Lily came to America with nothing.

00:02:47.180 --> 00:02:48.800
But here, she thrived…

00:02:48.800 --> 00:02:49.980
and last year,

00:02:52.680 --> 00:02:54.040
she ran for US Senate

00:02:54.040 --> 00:02:55.320
as a Libertarian.

00:02:55.360 --> 00:02:56.500
She polled high enough

00:02:56.500 --> 00:02:57.800
to make the debates.

00:03:03.320 --> 00:03:04.300
Her message was

00:03:04.300 --> 00:03:06.780
that life is terrible WITHOUT freedom.

00:03:19.560 --> 00:03:21.100
Before she became a Libertarian,

00:03:21.100 --> 00:03:23.220
she became a Republican.

00:03:23.220 --> 00:03:23.940
But then:

00:03:32.120 --> 00:03:34.520
I’ve abandoned free market principles

00:03:34.520 --> 00:03:36.420
to save the free market system.

00:03:57.560 --> 00:03:59.720
When Colorado debated gun control,

00:03:59.720 --> 00:04:01.564
she posted this picture on Facebook

00:04:01.564 --> 00:04:02.460
with the caption,

00:04:02.460 --> 00:04:04.220
“I once was a slave

00:04:04.220 --> 00:04:05.920
I will never be one again.”

00:04:13.060 --> 00:04:15.040
She told Colorado’s legislature,

00:04:15.040 --> 00:04:17.540
the history of China might have been different

00:04:17.540 --> 00:04:19.680
had the Chinese had a right to bear arms.

00:04:26.460 --> 00:04:28.620
Now she speaks at colleges.

00:04:28.620 --> 00:04:29.680
She says many young people

00:04:29.680 --> 00:04:31.820
haven't learned the lessons of Communism.

00:04:38.000 --> 00:04:39.840
So I hope more students listen to

00:04:39.840 --> 00:04:41.480
Lily Tang Williams.

